# The build context is shipped to the Docker daemon -- without this file a multi-gigabyte dump
# would travel along on every build. So: exclude everything first, then pull back in the little
# that the image needs (see COPY in the Dockerfile).
*

!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!cib7explorer/

# Inside cib7explorer/, take nothing built and no secrets.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/profiles.yaml
**/*.pw
